# Docs (vault = `docs/`)
- Frontmatter: `title`, `type` (PRD|Architecture|Database|Roadmap|Guide|Log), `status` (Draft|Active|Deprecated|Archived), `last_updated`, `tags`. Link with `[[filename]]`; new file → `docs/INDEX.md`.
- Progress goes ONLY to the current tech plan; CHANGELOG / project-status / roadmap / backlog are updated at release (`AGENTS.md` §3).
- `docs/09_Codebase/*` catalogs and `lessons_learned.md` are generated — edit sources, run `pnpm docs:gen`. CI runs `docs:check`.
- `docs/_learning/` is a separate private repo — don't touch.
